SUMMARY:Trail Cons. - Wishbone Bridge Ribbon Cutting Celebration
LOCATION:Longhorn Dam (30.249365\, -97.713288)
URL:https://thetrailconservancy.org/event/wishbone-bridge-ribbon-cutting-ce
 lebration/
DESCRIPTION:Wishbone Bridge & Unity Underpass Ribbon Cutting Celebration\nT
 he completion of the Wishbone Bridge marks a milestone for the Butler Trai
 l\, completing the 10-mile loop and creating a seamless\, traffic-free exp
 erience for Trail users! Join The Trail Conservancy and the City of Austin
  on Saturday\, February 7th\, from 10 a.m. to 12:30 p.m. for a celebration
  and party on the plaza and be one of the first to enjoy the new pedestria
 n bridge\, underpass\, and benches.\nRSVP: https://secure.qgiv.com/for/the
 trailconservancy/event/wishboneribboncutting/\nGetting There\nThere are th
 ree entrances to the Wishbone Bridge:\n- South of Longhorn Dam (entrance t
 o the Unity Underpass)\n- North of Longhorn Dam at the end of Canterbury S
 t.\n- North of the Longhorn Dam at the end of the old Holly peninsula\nAbo
 ut the Project\n…\n\nDetails: https://thetrailconservancy.org/event/wish
 bone-bridge-ribbon-cutting-celebration/
