SUMMARY:Trail Cons. - Merlin Tuttle Day: Congress Ave. Bat Celebration
LOCATION:Ann W. Richards Congress Avenue Bat Bridge\, 100 S Congress Ave\, 
 Austin\, TX 78704
URL:https://thetrailconservancy.org/event/merlin-tuttle-day-congress-ave-ba
 t-celebration/
DESCRIPTION:Merlin Tuttle Day: Congress Ave Bat Celebration\nThanks to reno
 wned bat conservationist Merlin Tuttle’s lifelong dedication\, bats are 
 now a staple of Austin’s culture. Former Austin Mayor Steve Adler offici
 ally proclaimed Merlin’s birthday\, August 26th\, as Merlin Tuttle Day i
 n honor of Merlin’s success in saving the city’s now world-famous bats
 . And this year\, we’re celebrating the addition of a new\, more interac
 tive visitor experience on the Trail: Bat City.\n…\n\nDetails: https://t
 hetrailconservancy.org/event/merlin-tuttle-day-congress-ave-bat-celebratio
 n/
CATEGORIES:special
X-CAM-ORG:trailcons
