SUMMARY:Trail Cons. - Open House: Eastside Family Garden Design Concepts
LOCATION:Lorraine “Grandma” Camacho Activity Center\, 35 Robert T Marti
 nez Jr St\, Austin\, TX 78702
URL:https://thetrailconservancy.org/event/design-concepts-eastside-family-g
 arden-project/
DESCRIPTION:Eastside Family Garden Project Open House\nSee the future of th
 e Trail’s Eastside! Join The Trail Conservancy at the Camacho Activity C
 enter to see the latest design and art concepts for the Eastside Family Ga
 rden project!\n- Breakfast tacos provided\n- Meet Lys Santamaria (project 
 artist consultant) and Edith Uresti from Rialto Studio (project landscape 
 architect) and learn about the artistic interpretation in the project\n- S
 ee the latest project designs and art concepts\nAbout the Project\nThe Eas
 tside Family Garden will revitalize over 2 acres of neglected parkland\, c
 reating a recreational space that blends traditional playscapes\, nature p
 lay\, and inviting gathering areas—all purposefully designed with shade\
 , native restoration\, and water access in mind.\n…\n\nDetails: https://
 thetrailconservancy.org/event/design-concepts-eastside-family-garden-proje
 ct/
